# DATA-SIZE EXCEPTION (plan §3.4): the raw UCI CSV is ~19 MB and the zip
# ~3.2 MB, over the portfolio file-size rule, so raw data is git-ignored
# and downloaded at build time by `python -m src.data_pipeline --live`.
# Only the small provenance artefacts are committed (sample_rows.json,
# IDS_mapping.csv, compact processed CSVs). This is the one deliberate
# deviation from the "do NOT ignore data/" rule (Day 1 lesson (d)).
data/raw/diabetic_data.csv
data/raw/*.zip
